on.png?v=0ae50baa40ed","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://math.stackexchange.com/questions/2529446/arbitrary-vs-random","original_url":"https://math.stackexchange.com/questions/2529446/arbitrary-vs-random"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9bcbba4-130c-4b3f-9ba5-f7825e4d1193","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"日常会話では、だいたい同意義ですね","ts":"1618475760.141700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a700ce06-1800-4bf8-96ff-9592c61dcdaa","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"まさにこのトランプの例だ","ts":"1618440320.140500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o3oQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c691ee0-27cb-4f96-8e6c-fbfb36dca54a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"これはわかりやすいですね","ts":"1618440300.140200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1NJ9s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"028af280-7d03-410c-b8b2-2b5575c167b2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Longman によると\narbitrary:  decided or arranged without any reason or plan, often unfairly\nrandom: happening or chosen without any definite plan, aim, or pattern\nとあって、違いが分かりやすいですね。どちらも plan なしに選ばれるものですが、arbitrary は「unfair でも良い」のです。\n一言で言えば最初に言ったとおり、 arbitrary は恣意的に選んでもよく、 random はあくまで無作為に選ぶ、ということ。","ts":"1618440252.140000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1618440305.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UEACRCY0Z","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F7jv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21b8da12-7525-44da-9f2f-132c68f18d52","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"「ポーカーやるよ! この中身みえてるトランプのカードから5つ選んで!」\nといわれて適当に3♡　7◆　8♡　Q:clubs:　Q♡　　を選んじゃうのがrandom\n吟味して　A♡　A◆　A:clubs:　A♤　:black_joker:　を選ぶこともできちゃうのがarbitrary","ts":"1618440136.137800","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1618440236.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+I8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c3f4a8a-0cb6-49f1-af8b-50d2c8b9124d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね \u0026gt; monaqa \u0026amp; tsuyoshicho","ts":"1618440000.134800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6=YzD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0d8b62a-0e55-42c4-9491-4b50fd4f6e85","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"random choice が無作為選出 arbitrary なら(基準はなくとも)任意選出感はある?","ts":"1618439986.134500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lr7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d5fff79-48b9-4fd8-ad7a-fd6b27f03430","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"数学書を読めば自然とニュアンスがつかめるようになるんですが","ts":"1618439971.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xran"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb1138ee-50ce-4ae7-bc96-4b9cf5e77e2d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"arbitrary は「どんな選び方をしても良い」、random は「選びての意志によって変に偏らないように選ぶ」というような違いですね。","ts":"1618439950.133400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tS+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4c3e360-3d57-4781-b5bc-28e832846236","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"いや、どっちも制限なさそう","ts":"1618438514.131300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NPE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b16413bf-b1ce-47a4-9e90-05b2ec9e4a9b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"arbitrary…制限がある\nrandom…無制限\nってことか？","ts":"1618438476.131000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type"